Template: flickimp/purge_data
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Delete FlickImp's configuration and database?
 FlickImp is being purged. Its data can be deleted as well:
 .
   /etc/flickimp      configuration, including your TMDB credentials
   /var/lib/flickimp  database: shows, movies, queues and watch history
 .
 This cannot be undone. Choose No to keep these files; installing
 FlickImp again will pick them up where you left off.
